1. Overview
GPS Area & Camera ("the App") is developed by Antfire Labs. This policy explains what information the App accesses, how it is used, and your rights.

2. Information We Collect

Location Data
The App accesses your device's GPS location to measure land area, perimeter, and distances. Location data is processed entirely on your device and is never transmitted to our servers.

Camera & Microphone
The App accesses your camera and microphone to let you capture photos and videos with GPS coordinate overlays. Media is saved only to your device's photo library and is never uploaded to our servers.

Photo Library
The App saves captured photos and videos to your device. It reads your library only when you choose to open a saved file within the App.

Advertising Data (Google AdMob)
The free tier of the App displays advertisements served by Google AdMob. Google may collect device identifiers and usage data to serve ads. You can review Google's privacy practices at: https://policies.google.com/privacy

Subscription & Purchase Data
Subscription purchases are processed entirely by Apple through the App Store. Antfire Labs does not collect or store your payment information. Apple's privacy policy applies to all transactions: https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/

Analytics
The App does not use any third-party analytics SDK. No usage data is sent to Antfire Labs.

3. Data Storage
All measurement records, photos, and videos you create in the App are stored locally on your device only. We do not operate servers that store your personal data.

4. Data Sharing
We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties, except as required by law or as described in section 2 (Google AdMob).

5. Children's Privacy
The App is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

6. Your Rights
Since all data is stored on your device, you can delete it at any time by deleting the App or clearing its data in iOS Settings.

7. Changes to This Policy
We may update this policy from time to time. The updated version will be posted at this URL with a new "Last updated" date.

8. Contact
If you have any questions about this privacy policy, contact us at: virvijay37@gmail.com

